@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### SERVICE-ORDERS - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /service-orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /service-orders/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /service-orders
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "OS-DEMO-001",
